      "summary": "Slow-cooked soft polenta enriched with butter and grated Parmigiano-Reggiano.",
      "method_md": "**🌽 Soft Polenta**\n**Ingredients**<br>☐ 1 cup (170 g) polenta<br>☐ 5 cups (1.2 L) water or light stock<br>☐ 1¼ tsp fine sea salt<br>☐ 3 tbsp butter<br>☐ ½ cup grated Parmigiano-Reggiano\n**Method**<br>☐ Bring liquid and salt to simmer<br>☐ Whisk in polenta slowly<br>☐ Cook on low 30–35 min, stirring often<br>☐ Stir in butter and cheese<br>☐ Loosen with hot water if needed",
